SUMMARY\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 VAxion512 is a deterministic vector transformer utilizing bit-level parallelism and Intel\'92s specialized rotation hardware. It is mathematically lossless (due to entropy-preserving rotation) and optimized to minimize memory fetches relative to compute cycles (High Arithmetic Intensity).\
